<TITLE>Light Control Computer</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>The light control computer is a device that supplies the alternating current (AC) power required to illuminate the HID bulb.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The frequency of the AC power is several hundred Hz or more so that no flicker is perceived during illumination, and electromagnetic shielding is provided so that electromagnetic waves do not affect the vehicle radio, etc.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
